tml=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="990" width="120" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ladder-45" value="γ-free test disagrees with the HM verdict" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#E07000;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="990" width="140" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ladder-46" value="Rejected boxes sit on the row of the baseline they were tested against; Δ is validation HM vs that baseline unless stated. Orange border: v5.5 and v5.13 passed on HM with no significant test AUSUC gain; v9, v13, v5.14 were rejected but have significant γ-free gains." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="990" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="inter" name="Interactions"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="inter-1" value="&lt;b&gt;Complementary vs overlapping&lt;/b&gt;: I = Δ(A+B) − ΔA − ΔB on validation HM (same images); test AUSUC in brackets. Green: complementary (combine). Amber: overlapping (keep the best). Red: antagonistic (do not combine)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1300" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="inter-2" value="&lt;b&gt;CSP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;learned crop/disease vectors" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="120" width="170" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell i