&gt;v11.4&lt;/b&gt; comp. GAN on LoRA&lt;br&gt;18.07 (-10.53) ✗&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;test γ0 31.4 · AUSUC 54.2&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontSize=9;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="508" width="135" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g0ladder-41" value="&lt;b&gt;v11.5&lt;/b&gt; GAN on v5.13 feats&lt;br&gt;26.71 (-1.89) ✗&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;test γ0 37.7 · AUSUC 54.9&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontSize=9;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="487" y="508" width="135" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g0ladder-42" value="&lt;b&gt;v12&lt;/b&gt; LoRA all blocks&lt;br&gt;15.25 (-13.35) ✗&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;test γ0 27.0 · AUSUC 57.4&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontSize=9;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="634" y="508" width="135" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g0ladder-43" value="&lt;b&gt;v13&lt;/b&gt; SSL local-global&lt;br&gt;8.21 (-14.49 s42) ✗&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;test γ0 41.2 · AUSUC 59.5&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontSize=9;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#555555;strokeColor=#E07000;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="781" y="508" width="135" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g0ladder-44" value="&lt;b&gt;v13.1&lt;/b&gt; SSL weight 20&lt;br&gt;8.22 (-14.48 s42) ✗&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;test γ0 28.9 · AUSUC 57.9&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontSize=9;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="928" y="508" width="135" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g0ladder-45" value="Promoted baseline" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="678" width="120" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g0ladder-46" value="Rejected (Δ ≤ +2)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="678" width="120" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g0ladder-47" value="Rejected, but a top γ-free recogniser" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#E07000;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="678" width="160" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g0ladder-48" value="Rejected boxes sit on the row of the baseline they were tested against (s42 = compared on validation split 42). At γ = 0, HM mostly rewards low seen bias: v11.3 wins although its AUSUC (52.7) is below v10.3, whose features it uses (56.3). Orange: LoRA (v5, v5.5), SSL (v13), v5.14 and the CNN ensembles (v6.5, v6.7) are rejected here but are the strongest recognisers by AUSUC." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="678" width="1260" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
